            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly Freeguild Steelhelms unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target and roll a dice.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">On a 2+, pick 1: On Your Feet!: If the target unit is not in combat, you can return D3 slain models to it. Yield No Quarter!: Add 3 to the target unit's control score until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic>
